   "verdict": "REVIEW",
   "why": "54 published pet-friendly hotels spread across 11 of this market's 14 admitting corridors, with 4 corridors reaching their own page-publication minimum. The publication set covers Downtown Greensboro, Coliseum, PTI Airport, High Point, Downtown Winston-Salem, Hanes Mall, North Winston-Salem, Kernersville, East Greensboro, Clemmons, Archdale. All three cores publish (Greensboro, Winston-Salem, High Point) plus Kernersville and the PTI airport corridor. It is NOT complete: 42 admitted identities remain unread -- Choice, Best Western, Extended Stay America, Red Roof, Motel 6 and Hyatt refused this client, and the independents and retired Wyndham routes carry no first-party route -- each for a named, recorded reason. The major-metro verdict needs 60 published hotels and 8 corridors; this market publishes 54, so the verdict is REVIEW and is not tuned to pass."
